<title>SWITZERLAND: Ascom, Moevenpick sales on Friday.</title>
<headline>Ascom, Moevenpick sales on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss telecommunications company Ascom Holding AG and food and hotel group Moevenpick AG will report 1996 sales figures on Friday.</p>
<p>Ascom will report its sales results around 0800 GMT, a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Moevenpick will report its sales figures, and a forecast for 1996 profits, between 0700 and 0800 GMT, a company spokesman said in response to inquiries.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
